 I've been on the road kind of nonstop since my book was published in July, but I, you know, I've been traveling lots prior to that.

00:30:46.760 --> 00:30:52.940
 And I, if anybody ever invites me out to their neck of the world, neck of the woods to give a cheese making workshop, I, you know, I have a hard time saying no.

00:30:53.360 --> 00:30:58.480
 And so I, I, I, you know, if I can take time to go out and travel and teach, I will.

