 Um, we, my, my partner, Catherine and I anticipate, uh, two years of traveling and teaching, um, across Canada, uh, North America.

00:32:27.320 --> 00:32:31.280
 Uh, we were invited up to Australia to, to teach and we're going to be going there in March.

00:32:31.460 --> 00:32:36.760
 You know, we foresee traveling and promoting this book for a pretty long time to help assure its success.

